    "created_at": "2026-05-31T22:58:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-31T22:58:15Z",
    "body": "@mifi I believe I found the cause, here's a repro video: [2494-repro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28445851/2494-repro.zip)\nThe issue seems to be triggered by:  \n - source video stream has non-zero `start_time`\n - the smart/reencode pre-keyframe fragment is smaller than this offset\n\nWhen generating the reencode fragment, the newer ffmpeg bundled with 3.65+ produces an audio-only file in those circumstances, and then the subsequent concat fails.",
